-- Paraiso de Anime MINIUPDATE | Rayfield Gen2
-- Farm tab (complete): Current-world MULTI-SELECT mobs, Reload Mobs,
-- Teleport/Tween/Legit, Above/Below/Behind, Farm Distance,
-- a 12x12 Below support platform, auto-return to surface on farm OFF,
-- Auto Farm, Auto Click, Units Auto Attack; Units tab / Stars section
-- includes Equip Best, Auto Fuse by selected material rarity into all eligible equipped units, Auto Sell,
-- world star selector, Open 1 / Open 3, and Auto Open Stars.
-- Inventory cleanup: BULK fuse ALL eligible selected-rarity materials into
-- the user's equipped units (one verified material-list request at a time), and
-- BULK sell ALL eligible selected-rarity units in one Sell_Bulk request.
-- The threshold triggers a COMPLETE cleanup cycle, even below threshold.
-- Trials/Tower/Raids: select raid, join/create queues, independent per-mode farming,
-- Trial wave auto-leave, and automatic Game Result dismissal.
-- Trial auto-join watches Trial.Open and calls Join only (no lobby Enter).
-- Tower automation creates the player-owned room and joins ONLY that room.
-- Misc tab: Auto Claim Achievements, Daily Rewards, Level Rewards, and Chests
-- via the game's native Auto Chest setting (NOT an invented claim remote).
-- Misc Auto Quest: independently accepts, travels to, attacks, and claims
-- current-world storyline quests WITHOUT requiring Auto Farm to be enabled.
-- Auto Quest borrows Farm Method, Position, and Distance as read-only movement
-- preferences. It never enables/disables Auto Farm or changes selected mobs.
-- If both toggles are on, the active quest mob has movement/target priority;
-- manual Auto Farm resumes once the quest is no longer active.
-- Combat actions use the game's ReplicatedStorage.Remotes.Bridge.
-- Movement uses Roblox character APIs; the game has no client movement remote here.

